<title>JAPAN: Kazokutei -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Kazokutei -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.00		vs	    3.78</p>
<p> Operating	  221    million	  vs	  178    million</p>
<p> Current	    161    million	  vs	  122    million</p>
